  "title": "Learn Python with Opentrons for Education: Protocol Designer",
  "summary": "If you’ve been saving time at the bench with Opentrons robots for a while, you might be familiar with Protocol Designer, our no-code protocol creation tool. Launched in 2018, Protocol Designer lets you visually design a protocol for the Flex or OT-2 robot. Simply click to add labware, hardware, and protocol steps. When you’re finished, […] The post Learn Python with Opentrons for Education: Protocol Designer appeared first on Opentrons .",
